ids </c><00:00:08.242><c>find </c><00:00:08.244><c>their </c><00:00:08.246><c>own </c><00:00:08.248><c>voice  </c><00:00:08.250><c>and </c><00:00:08.252><c>our </c><00:00:08.254><c>challenge </c><00:00:08.256><c>as </c><00:00:08.258><c>a </c><00:00:08.260><c>society </c><00:00:08.262><c>is </c><00:00:08.264><c>to  </c><00:00:08.266><c>give </c><00:00:08.268><c>our </c><00:00:08.270><c>kids </c><00:00:08.272><c>the </c><00:00:08.274><c>space </c><00:00:08.276><c>to </c><00:00:08.278><c>develop  </c><00:00:08.280><c>within </c><00:00:08.282><c>their </c><00:00:08.284><c>own </c><00:00:08.286><c>radius </c><00:00:08.288><c>of </c><00:00:08.290><c>play </c><00:00:08.292><c>thank  </c><00:00:08.294><c>you </c><00:00:08.296><c>very </c><00:00:08.298><c>much  </c><00:00:08.300><c>you</c>

